{"id":"udacha","lemma":"удача","pos":"noun","rank":1728,"glosses":["good luck, success (achievement of one's aim or goal)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e2/Ru-%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"удачи","plural":"удачи"},"examples":[{"text":"Удача против меня.","en":"Luck is against me.","words":[null,{"g":"against"},{"g":"me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Вам не нужна удача.","en":"You don't need luck.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1274803","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},{"g":"not"},null,null]},{"text":"Удача была на нашей стороне.","en":"Luck was on our side.","words":[null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},null]},{"text":"Вот что называется — удача.","en":"That's what you call good luck.","words":[{"g":"here is"},{"g":"what / that"},null,null]},{"text":"Рано или поздно его удача иссякнет.","en":"Sooner or later, his luck will run out.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/661038","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"him / his"},null,null],"phrases":[[0,3,"sooner or later"]]}]}